<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Weekly Summary - Saarthi</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

body {
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
  background-color: #0a0e1a;
  color: #e2e8f0;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.container {
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 40px 20px;
}

.card {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
  border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.1);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 40px;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

.logo {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}

.logo-text {
  font-size: 28px;
  font-weight: 800;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00F5FF, #7B61FF);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  background-clip: text;
}

h1 {
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #f8fafc;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  text-align: center;
}

.subtitle {
  text-align: center;
  color: #94a3b8;
  font-size: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}

.greeting {
  font-size: 16px;
  color: #e2e8f0;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.greeting span {
  color: #00F5FF;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.stats-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.stat-card {
  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
  border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.08);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 20px;
  text-align: center;
}

.stat-icon {
  font-size: 28px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.stat-value {
  font-size: 32px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #00F5FF;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.stat-value.purple {
  color: #7B61FF;
}

.stat-value.pink {
  color: #ec4899;
}

.stat-value.amber {
  color: #f59e0b;
}

.stat-label {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #64748b;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.full-width-stat {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 20px 24px;
}

.full-width-stat .stat-info {
  text-align: left;
}

.best-day {
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #10b981;
}

.progress-bar {
  background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.1);
  border-radius: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.progress-fill {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00F5FF, #7B61FF);
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 8px;
}

.divider {
  height: 1px;
  background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.1);
  margin: 28px 0;
}

.cta-container {
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 24px;
}

.cta-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00F5FF, #00d4e0);
  color: #0f172a;
  padding: 12px 28px;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.footer {
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 32px;
  color: #475569;
  font-size: 12px;
}

.encouragement {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1), rgba(123, 97, 255, 0.1));
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 16px;
  text-align: center;
  margin: 20px 0;
}

  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">

  <div class="logo">
    <div class="logo-text">SAARTHI</div>
  </div>

  <h1>📊 Weekly Progress Report</h1>

  <p class="subtitle">
    <%= weekStart %> — <%= weekEnd %>
  </p>

  <p class="greeting">
    Hi <span><%= name %></span>, here's how you performed this week! 🚀
  </p>

  <div class="stats-grid">

    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-icon">💻</div>
      <div class="stat-value"><%= stats.problemsSolved %></div>
      <div class="stat-label">Problems Solved</div>
    </div>

    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-icon">🧠</div>
      <div class="stat-value purple"><%= stats.mcqsAttempted %></div>
      <div class="stat-label">MCQs Attempted</div>
    </div>

    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-icon">🎯</div>
      <div class="stat-value pink"><%= stats.accuracy %>%</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Accuracy</div>
      <div class="progress-bar">
        <div class="progress-fill" style="width: <%= progressWidth %>%"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-icon">🔥</div>
      <div class="stat-value amber"><%= stats.activeDays %>/7</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Active Days</div>
    </div>

    <div class="stat-card full-width-stat">
      <div class="stat-info">
        <div class="stat-label">⭐ Best Day</div>
        <div class="best-day"><%= stats.bestDay %></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-icon">🏆</div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="encouragement">
    <% if (stats.activeDays >= 5) { %>
      <p>🔥 Incredible consistency! You're on fire this week! Keep the momentum going!</p>
    <% } else if (stats.activeDays >= 3) { %>
      <p>💪 Great effort! You're building a solid habit.</p>
    <% } else if (stats.problemsSolved > 0 || stats.mcqsAttempted > 0) { %>
      <p>🌱 Every step counts! Try to practice daily.</p>
    <% } else { %>
      <p>🚀 Ready to start your learning journey?</p>
    <% } %>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="cta-container">
    <a href="<%= dashboardLink %>" class="cta-btn">Open Dashboard</a>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>You're receiving this because you're subscribed to weekly summaries.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 8px;">
      © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Saarthi
    </p>
  </div>

</div>

  </div>
</body>

</html>
